{
 "schema_version": 1,
 "note": "The UN Statistics Division's M49 standard (Standard country or area codes for statistical use) as data: each country or area with an ISO code and the M49 region (continent), sub-region and intermediate region the UN puts it in, plus the English and Chinese names of those groups as the UN prints them. Read by the knowledge group to group countries (for example the EU members by European sub-region, or World Bank economies by their continent's sub-region). Nothing here is hand-written: every row and name is read from the two CSVs named in source (kept outside the repository), which scripts/test_m49_regions.py checks by hash and row by row when they are given. The UN's grouping is kept as is (Cyprus is in Western Asia; Antarctica has no region). Ownership only; no cross-group call is allowed by this file.",
 "source": {
  "url": "https://unstats.un.org/unsd/methodology/m49/overview/",
  "how": "The page has no CSV file to link to: its 'CSV' button (DataTables export) builds the file in the browser from the page's table. The stored copies are the files that button produced for the English table (semicolon-separated, with a byte-order mark) and the Chinese table (comma-separated, quoted), saved unchanged. A cross-check against the page's HTML fetched the same day matched every code and name.",
  "fetched_at": "2026-11-23",
  "document_sha256": "035a35af597250e35c0c32c1fe866a5b8c60c292f5dfcd463fe23b264b8491ee",
  "file": "m49-overview-en.csv",
  "zh_document_sha256": "da5edce5dee15447aacafe1b3a900e9d82e76e8786ba26a61c92e4ad4aeebd4d",
  "zh_file": "m49-overview-zh.csv",
  "licence_note": {
   "quote": "The United Nations grants permission to Users to visit the Site and to download and copy the information, documents and materials (collectively, “Materials”) from the Site for the User’s personal, non-commercial use, without any right to resell or redistribute them or to compile or create derivative works therefrom, subject to the terms and conditions outlined below, and also subject to more specific restrictions that may apply to specific Material within this Site.",
   "url": "https://www.un.org/en/about-us/terms-of-use",
   "where": "Linked as 'Terms of Use' from the footer of the M49 overview page; the page itself states no other licence."
  },
  "stored_copy": "The two CSV files are kept outside the repository (the UN terms of use allow personal use without redistribution); only their names and sha256 are recorded here. The test checks this file against them when they are given (M49_SOURCE_DIR), and for self-consistency always."
